; A cost spec beancount's grammar cannot read drops its transaction: an
; operator other than `#` between its numbers, braces never closed, and a
; compound `#` with no currency.
2020-01-01 open Assets:A
2020-01-01 open Assets:B

2020-01-02 *
  Assets:A  1 HOOL {10 & 5 USD}
  Assets:B

2020-01-03 *
  Assets:A  1 HOOL {10 USD
  Assets:B

2020-01-04 *
  Assets:A  1 HOOL {1 # 2}
  Assets:B

2020-01-05 balance Assets:A 0 HOOL
